{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06212","headline":"游悟真寺 · 王缙","name":"游悟真寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道黄金地，仍开白玉田。\n掷山移巨石，呪岭出飞泉。\n猛虎同三径，愁猨学四禅。\n买香然绿桂，乞火蹈红莲。\n草色摇霞上，松声泛月边。\n山河穷百二，世界接三千。\n梵宇聊凭视，王城遂渺然。\n灞陵才出树，渭水欲连天。\n远县分朱郭，孤村起白烟。\n望云思圣主，披雾忆羣贤。\n薄宦惭尸素，终身拟尚玄。\n谁知草庵客，曾和柏梁篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王缙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}